    {
      "title": "How It Works",
      "content": "AutoGen uses a <strong>unified conversation interface</strong> among agents, along with <strong>auto-reply mechanisms</strong>, to establish an agent-interaction interface. This interface capitalizes on the strengths of chat-optimized LLMs with broad capabilities while accommodating a wide range of applications. Developers can create agents with specialized capabilities and roles by reusing or extending built-in agents.",
