    {
      "title": "The Results",
      "content": "AutoGen has been demonstrated to achieve outstanding performance on various tasks, including <strong>math problem solving</strong>, <strong>retrieval-augmented code generation</strong>, and <strong>conversational chess</strong>. The framework has also been shown to reduce development code and manual burden for existing applications. Additionally, AutoGen enables <strong>multi-agent chats</strong> to follow a dynamic pattern rather than fixed back-and-forth interactions.",
