    {
      "title": "Why It Matters",
      "content": "AutoGen has the potential to revolutionize the way we develop LLM applications. By providing a <strong>general framework</strong> for creating and experimenting with multi-agent systems, AutoGen enables developers to create complex applications with ease. The framework also promotes <strong>modularity</strong> and simplifies overall development and code management. Furthermore, AutoGen enables humans to engage in activities alongside multiple AI agents in a conversational manner.",
